                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-06-13"><hi rendition="#italic">June 13,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Instructions on subject your telegram 3d instant, mailed to you and other
                    ambassadors in Europe June 10.<anchor n="a" xml:id="d310-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
